I thought that I've been hurt before, 
but watching Bron be injured hurt me more. 
If he needed new legs, I'd offer mine, 
but we all know he will not reach that time. 
Every player is going under, 
cause LeBron is the greatest who's alive. 
If you don't agree, my brother, move on.
I watch you ballin' till I can't see, dribblin', 
happy when you score threes. 
So if LeBron ever misses, I'll be needing stitches. 
Haters trippin' out the O.L., 
fuck em' up, beat em' with my own belt. 
So if LeBron ever misses, I'll be needing stitches.